# T'Pring, Never Parted: the two targets are "another target creature you control" - T'Pring itself is no target, and
# neither is an artifact Bot1 controls (CR 115.1) - and one an opponent controls; Bot1's Grizzly Bears is chosen for the
# first. Bot1 then declines the "you may have the chosen creatures fight each other", so neither creature deals damage,
# the delayed ability is never set up, and nothing is drawn (CR 701.14b, 608.2d): Bot1's hand is only the turn's draw.

